# Syntax
[[ spaced target | spaced label ]]
[[a|b|c]] keeps the second bar in the label
[[a\|b|label]] has an escaped bar in the target
[[a\]]b]] has an escaped bracket
[[]] and [[ ]] and [[|x]] are text
[[unclosed is text
[[a]] [[b]] are two links
`[[in code]]` is not a link
[[x `y`]] holds no code
